  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intermediate Results Indicator</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="1" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proportion of bi-monthly payments based on a complete cycle of co-responsibilities verification and application of sanctions</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2008-01-31" value="0%" year="2008">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2008-01-31"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2014-05-31"></period-end>
     <target value="75%"></target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">No data available.  Non compliance has been identified based on partial verification of corresponsibilities and resulted inWarningLetters to participant households. The system of verification of co-responsibilities (to be strengthened) will produceestimates forthe entire population by April 30, 2014.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intermediate Results Indicator</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="1" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Share of jurisdictions covered by the RO with Technical support teams for the accompaniment of families</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2008-01-31" value="0%" year="2008">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2008-01-31"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2014-05-31"></period-end>
     <target value="100%"></target>
     <actual value="56%">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">While there was progress towards meeting the target, it was not achieved. By May 2014, 328 corregimientos were covered bypromotores (out of 586) representing 56% of corregimientos. This lower achievement of accompaniment of families (promotores) isexplained by the budgetary cuts, uncertain fiscal situation and attrition of promotores. There were originally planned 400promotores hired with external financing. Currently there are only 219.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDO Indicator</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="1" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Percentage of RO beneficiary children 4 to 17 years old who are enrolled and attend school (in compliance of their education co-responsibility).</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2008-01-31" value="50%" year="2008">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2008-01-31"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2014-05-31"></period-end>
     <target value="90%"></target>
     <actual value="59%">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partially achieved, due to limitation in the coverage of information system.  The current measure, of 56,367 children withverifiedco-responsibilities out of 133,852 (59%), represents an increase from 45% in previous measures (54,900 out of 121,000),reflecting the gradual expansion in the monitoring capacity.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
